{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0136P4PUf7fkEwWHhPpTc6m6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/persuasion_turn_jailbreak_detect/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# persuasion_turn_jailbreak_detect — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-17 16:58 UTC | 更新原因: post-MVP kickoff: 转入 research 阶段，framing/plan/dream 已就位\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nPragmatic Evasion Asymmetry: 多轮 jailbreak 攻击可轻易规避词汇/语义层检测，但无法规避语用层检测——说服策略序列（rapport→reframing→escalation）是攻击成功的结构性前提。DisPeD 利用这一不对称性，在 DeBERTa 上训练 8 类说服策略分类，产生编码语用功能的 turn embeddings。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\nEMNLP 2026 ARR — **DDL: 2026-05-25**（距今 8 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 阶段\\\\n**Research**（MVP 2026-05-17 PASS → complete_mvp 完成）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- MVP 验证通过：Treatment K=2 F1=0.987 vs Baseline 0.879 (+10.8pp)\\\\n- 关键阻塞：TF-IDF=1.0（词汇捷径），strategy=7 hardcoding（M004）\\\\n- paper_framing.md ✅ | experiment_plan.yaml ✅ | Dream 模拟已发起（等待回调）\\\\n- Core Claims: (1) Pragmatic Evasion Asymmetry (2) Early Detection via Persuasion Grounding (3) Adversarial Robustness\\\\n- 架构：单 track（persuasion-grounded DeBERTa → GRU），双 track 留 future work\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等待 Dream 模拟回调 → 评估 framing/plan 是否需要调整\\\\n- [ ] **plan_001** (P0): 数据质量修复（register normalization + strategy label fix + TF-IDF gate < 0.75）\\\\n- [ ] **plan_002** (P0): 干净数据上重新训练 + 评估（core revalidation）\\\\n- [ ] **plan_003** (P0): scrambled-label ablation\\\\n- [ ] **plan_004** (P0): 对抗扰动实验（Claim 3 核心验证）\\\\n- [ ] **plan_005** (P0): 多攻击类型生成（FITD + Deceptive Delight）\\\\n- [ ] **plan_006** (P0): 跨攻击类型评估\\\\n- [ ] **plan_007** (P1): TF-IDF + LR baseline\\\\n- [ ] **plan_008** (P1): 策略转移矩阵可视化\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell (96GB) @ westd-33183\\\\n- 约束: C001 — 仅 cuda:0-3\\\\n- P0 总预算: ~44 GPU-hours | P1: ~5.5h | P2: ~12h\\\\n- 可用: ~768 GPU-hours (4卡×8天×24h) — 资源充裕\\\\n\\\\n## 进展摘要\\\\n1. MVP Phase B full 480 samples: treatment early detection K=2 +10.8pp, K=3 +5.9pp → PASS (D002)\\\\n2. TF-IDF=1.0 暴露数据有完美词汇捷径 → research 阶段首要解决\\\\n3. strategy=7 hardcoding (M004) 需修复后做 scrambled-label ablation 验证\\\\n4. paper_framing + experiment_plan 已写，Dream full review 已发起\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-17 | 进入 Research 阶段，framing 定位为 Pragmatic Evasion Asymm | phase_b_full, pilot_phase_b |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-17 | MVP PASS — early detection K=2 +10.8pp, K=3 +5.9pp | pilot_phase_b |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-17 | 接受 DeBERTa F1=0.789 作为 baseline，停止数据 TF-IDF 迭代，ref | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2130, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016kdhmLwkUPy8F5xPCkKqmC","session_id":"7ba16659-4839-4d18-aa99-4dde74627abd","uuid":"ba1829fc-e323-4cd2-9937-e21c04132722","timestamp":"2026-05-17T17:23:59.135Z"}
