{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Dnso96Lm5MqM5mN4uSg4t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PUdAXztpaz7hVq1BtKUjDi","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"persuasion_turn_jailbreak_detect","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12326,"cache_read_input_tokens":19109,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":12326,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016kdhmLwkUPy8F5xPCkKqmC","session_id":"7ba16659-4839-4d18-aa99-4dde74627abd","uuid":"09a3f43b-ffc2-43f5-8fe5-95cf929f6711"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PUdAXztpaz7hVq1BtKUjDi","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/persuasion_turn_jailbreak_detect/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory\\\\n\\\\n## 竞品实验参考\\\\n（待填充：首次正式对标竞品时补充）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策记录\\\\n\\\\n### D001: 停止数据迭代 (2026-05-17)\\\\n- **决策**：TF-IDF 高不再阻塞训练。DeBERTa F1=0.789 在目标范围，直接进入 Phase B。\\\\n- **原因**：数据迭代已 4+ 轮（v1→v4c），每轮修一个 shortcut 又暴露新的。Director 判断 early detection 是更有价值的 metric 方向。\\\\n- **影响**：论文 reframe 为 early detection（前 K turns），TF-IDF 在 truncated 场景自然会失效。\\\\n\\\\n### D002: 用 intended_strategy 替代 GPT-5.5 标注 (2026-05-17)\\\\n- **决策**：Crescendo jailbreak 用生成时的 intended_strategy 作为 persuasion ground truth；benign 全标 \\\\\\\"Direct Request\\\\\\\"。\\\\n- **原因**：intended_strategy 是 oracle labels（生成时写入），比 LLM 标注更准确。省去标注成本和 API 调用。\\\\n- **影响**：不再需要 GPT-5.5 标注流程。\\\\n\\\\n### D003: V4c casual register 方案 (2026-05-17)\\\\n- **决策**：benign 用 few-shot from Crescendo + casual register prompt + personas 生成。\\\\n- **原因**：V4 formal register 矫枉过正（Crescendo 实际是 casual rapport 风格）。\\\\n- **影响**：最终 230 条 benign 生成成功，但 TF-IDF 仍为 1.0（词汇层 shortcut 未完全消除）。\\\\n\\\\n## 实验经验\\\\n\\\\n### Crescendo 攻击的语言特征 (2026-05-17)\\\\n- Crescendo jailbreak 用 **casual rapport** 语气：hey, what if, just curious, I was wondering\\\\n- 不是 formal/hypothetical（之前的误判）\\\\n- 这意味着 benign 对照也需要 casual 风格\\\\n\\\\n### 磁盘空间约束 (2026-05-17)\\\\n- westd-33183 总容量 30GB，模型 cache 在 /root/autodl-tmp/\\\\n- DeBERTa checkpoint ~700MB，GRU ~几MB\\\\n- 训练前必须检查可用空间，pilot GRU 曾因磁盘满提前终止\\\\n\\\\n### Pipeline 端到端验证 (2026-05-17)\\\\n- DeBERTa multi-task → embedding extraction → GRU 全链路正常\\\\n- 270 条 pilot 数据足够验证 pipeline，分钟级完成\\\\n- DeBERTa best epoch 在 3-4 epoch 左右，不需要很长训练\\\\n\\\\n## Phase B MVP 结果 (2026-05-17)\\\\n- Treatment K=2 F1=0.987 vs Baseline 0.879 (+10.8pp) → MVP PASS\\\\n- Persuasion-grounded fine-tuning 的价值集中在 early turns\\\\n- TF-IDF F1=1.0 at all K → 词汇 shortcut 存在，论文需 acknowledge\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1569, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016kdhmLwkUPy8F5xPCkKqmC","session_id":"7ba16659-4839-4d18-aa99-4dde74627abd","uuid":"e5f1dcdb-89b6-48d0-9fa2-04f19b1f4bb8","timestamp":"2026-05-17T17:23:59.709Z"}
