{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BkbARKyGZwjY8JDbB8AUHf","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 persuasion_turn_jailbreak_detect 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (2 个)\\n\\n- **phase_b_full**: DONE (success) — \\n- **pilot_phase_b**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-17\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **phase_b_full** (success): Persuasion-grounded DeBERTa embeddings (multi-task fine-tuned on 8-class persuasion + intent) enable significantly earlier detection of Crescendo jailbreak attacks compared to vanilla DeBERTa embeddings, especially at low K (2-3 turns) ← 基于 pilot_phase_b\\n- **pilot_phase_b** (success): Persuasion-aware DeBERTa embeddings (multi-task fine-tuned) fed to Bi-GRU will outperform vanilla DeBERTa embeddings at early detection (K=2,3,5 turns) of Crescendo-style jailbreak attacks\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 2 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 2\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-33183: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VUjfaBtFooCZeMsFqeiGpi","session_id":"7ba16659-4839-4d18-aa99-4dde74627abd","uuid":"c947e30b-3051-4974-86de-75da7bd47b0a","timestamp":"2026-05-17T17:24:03.806Z"}
